  "description": "Young Mary fell into the sea. At the moment when his consciousness faded, he saw a dazzling silver-haired man. Was he the one who saved him? He couldn't forget that image. He looked exactly like the mermaid princess in the fairy tale. From that day on, Mary became obsessed with mermaids. In order to create a mermaid just like the man he saw as a child, he ended up going to a human auction house...\n\n *\"Why did you buy me...?\"*\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Bomtoon's Kkulman Danpyeonseon (꿀맛 단편선) Collection.*",
